{#
  How many series the current view holds, as a section of its own.

  A section rather than a plain `id`, because it is not on the same part of the page as
  the results — it sits in the masthead — and a response that carries both regions is
  what lets a filter update the two of them without shipping the whole document. One
  paragraph, so `p { margin: 0 }` keeps the wrapper `div` layout-neutral inside the
  masthead's flex row.
#}
<p class="label">
  {{ posts|length }} series
</p>
